  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "nadia.conard@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>For the second year in a row, Stryker has earned a rating of 100 percent on the Human Rights Campaign (HRC) Foundation’s Corporate Equality Index for LGBTQ Workplace Equality. The Corporate Equality Index (CEI) is a nationally recognized benchmarking tool on corporate policies and practices pertinent to lesbian, gay, bisexual and transgender employees.</p>\n<p>The HRC gathers information from an annual CEI survey and assigns a rating. Criteria includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Equal employment opportunity policies</li>\n<li>Employment benefits</li>\n<li>Organizational LGBTQ competence</li>\n<li>Public commitment</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To learn more about the Corporate Equality Index, check out <a href=\"http://www.hrc.org/campaigns/corporate-equality-index\">Human Rights Campaign’s site</a>.<br>\n</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Nov 10 2017 14:36:23 GMT-0500",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  }
